{"ID":"20231122153108-bl2gale","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20231122153108-bl2gale","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122153108-bl2gale\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122160228-qqtgwqf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122160228-gc0ex5v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1421,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122160228-gc0ex5v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"第三十八篇 欬论","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"ID":"20231122160228-qqtgwqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-qqtgwqf","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"本篇要点："}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-wd5om17","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-wd5om17","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一、咳嗽的病变，固属于肺，而五脏六腑的病变，又都能影响于肺，使之功能失常，发为咳嗽。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-89ctern","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-89ctern","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二、咳嗽发病与四时有很大关系。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-fdlisw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-fdlisw3","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三、咳嗽日久不愈，脏病可以移腑。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-4w8vcz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-4w8vcz8","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"四、指出咳嗽的治疗原则。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-ju4cq32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-ju4cq32","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文和翻译"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-769g7v9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-769g7v9","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"问曰：肺之令人咳何也？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-ktca5ep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-ktca5ep","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝问道：肺脏有病，都能使人咳嗽，这是什麽道理？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-j9szxhe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-j9szxhe","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对曰：五脏六腑皆令人咳，非独肺也。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-6seg00u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-6seg00u","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯回答说：五脏六腑有病，都能使人咳嗽，不单是肺病如此。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-wofbemg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-wofbemg","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帝曰：愿闻其状？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-wxpdg3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-wxpdg3t","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝说：请告诉我各种咳嗽的症状。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-3oz3uso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-3oz3uso","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯曰：皮毛者肺之合也。皮毛先受邪气，邪气以从其合也。其寒饮食人胃，从肺脉上至于肺，则肺寒，肺寒则外内合，邪因而客之，则为肺咳。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-fkvvzg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-fkvvzg4","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯说：皮毛与肺是想配合的，皮毛先感受了外邪，邪气就会影响到肺脏。再由于吃了寒冷的饮食，寒气在胃循着肺脉上于肺，引起肺寒，这样就使内外寒邪相合，停留于肺脏，从而成为肺咳。这是肺咳的情况。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-pcjc5td","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-pcjc5td","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五脏各以其时受病，非其时,各传以与之。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-rkym6r0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-rkym6r0","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"至于五脏六腑之咳，是五脏各在其所主的时令受病，并非在肺的主时受病，而是各脏之病传给肺的。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-sdvk3b8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-sdvk3b8","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人与天地相参，故五脏各以治时，感于寒则受病，微则为咳，甚者为泄为痛。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-d7vuecy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-d7vuecy","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人和自然界是相应的，故五脏在其所主的时令受了寒邪，使能得病，若轻微的，则发生咳嗽，严重的，寒气入里就成为腹泻、腹痛。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-megc032","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-megc032","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乘秋则肺先受邪，乘春则肝先受之，乘夏则心先受之，乘至阴则脾先受之，乘冬则肾先受之。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-ntrm7rd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-ntrm7rd","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以当秋天的时候，肺先受邪；当春天的时候，肝先受邪；当夏天的时候，心先受邪；当长夏太阴主时，脾先受邪；当冬天的时候，肾先受邪。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-3qz3szq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-3qz3szq","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帝曰：何以异之？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-vjs6s8t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-vjs6s8t","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝道：这些咳嗽怎样鉴别呢？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-myrlplw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-myrlplw","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯曰：肺咳之状，咳而喘息有音，甚则唾血。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-vn3a50g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-vn3a50g","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯说：肺咳的症状，咳而气喘，呼吸有声，甚至唾血。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-w4xe20q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-w4xe20q","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心咳之状，咳则心痛，喉中介介如梗状，甚则咽肿，喉痹。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-043clqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-043clqc","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心咳的症状，咳则心痛，喉中好象有东西梗塞一样，甚至咽喉肿痛闭塞。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-8vc2noa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-8vc2noa","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝咳之状，咳则两胁下痛，甚则不可以转，转则两胠下满。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-tqb9xgw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-tqb9xgw","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝咳的症状，咳则两侧胁肋下疼痛，甚至痛得不能转侧，转侧则两胁下胀满。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-xm8hrca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-xm8hrca","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脾咳之状，咳则右胁下痛，阴阴引肩背，甚则不可以动，动则咳剧。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-vblz95p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-vblz95p","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脾咳的症状，咳则右胁下疼痛，并隐隐然疼痛牵引肩背，甚至不可以动，一动就会使咳嗽加剧。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-iqwrwn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-iqwrwn7","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肾咳之状，咳则腰背相引而痛，甚则咳涎。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-qhc7bss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-qhc7bss","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肾咳的症状，咳则腰背互相牵引作痛，甚至咳吐痰涎。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-1jbeo6d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-1jbeo6d","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帝曰：六腑之咳奈何？安所受病？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-q667lg6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-q667lg6","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝道：六腑咳嗽的症状如何？是怎样受病的？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-pf6y3uc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-pf6y3uc","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯曰：五脏之久咳，乃移于六腑。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-q7ujpyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-q7ujpyb","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯说：五脏咳嗽日久不愈，就要传移于六腑。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-ck85lyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-ck85lyn","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脾咳不已，则胃受之。胃咳之状，咳而呕，呕甚则长虫出。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-fothe81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-fothe81","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"例如脾咳不愈，则胃就受病；胃咳的症状，咳而呕吐，甚至呕出蛔虫。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-e5ea3pp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-e5ea3pp","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝咳不已则胆受之，胆咳之状，咳呕胆汁。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-8mmo1vy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-8mmo1vy","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝咳不愈，则胆就受病，胆咳的症状是咳而呕吐胆汁。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-rnle0b1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-rnle0b1","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺咳不已则大肠变之，大肠咳状，咳而遗失。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-h284sqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-h284sqd","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺咳不愈，则大肠受病，大肠咳的症状，咳而大便失禁。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-90me2zu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-90me2zu","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心咳不已则小肠受之，小肠咳状，咳而失气，气与咳俱失。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-6k2o1y1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-6k2o1y1","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心咳不愈，则小肠受病，小肠咳的症状是咳而放屁，而且往往是咳嗽与失气同时出现。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-tzrqs05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-tzrqs05","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肾咳不已则膀胱受之，膀胱咳状，咳而遗溺。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-mfz71yi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-mfz71yi","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肾咳不愈，则膀胱受病；膀胱咳的症状，咳而遗尿。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-yehsafa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-yehsafa","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"久咳不已则三焦受之，三焦咳状，咳而腹满不欲食饮。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-guu8c9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-guu8c9s","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以上各种咳嗽，如经久不愈，则使三焦受病，三焦咳的症状，咳而腹满，不想饮食。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-6rj3um1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-6rj3um1","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此皆紧于胃关于肺，使人多涕唾而面浮肿气逆也。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-7zcuwgw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-7zcuwgw","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凡此咳嗽，不论由于那一脏腑的病变，其邪必聚于胃，并循着肺的经脉而影响及肺，才能使人多痰涕，面部浮肿，咳嗽气逆。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-zvps6bb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-zvps6bb","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帝曰：治之奈何？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-v8ovasz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-v8ovasz","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝道：治疗的方法怎样？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-qqi5fjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-qqi5fjm","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯曰：治脏者治其俞，治腑者治其合，浮肿者治其经。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-gsm5jfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-gsm5jfs","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯说：治五脏的咳，取其俞穴；治六腑的咳，取其合穴；凡咳而浮肿的，可取有关脏腑的经穴而分治之。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-00nthz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-00nthz6","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帝曰：善。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160228-gc0ex5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160228-gc0ex5v","updated":"20231122160228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝道：讲得好！"}]}]}